Subject: scripts: port the compiler wrapper to Python 3 and reap failures

Retain the warning allowlist and compiler error codes. Wait for the
compiler before removing a rejected object, so a child cannot recreate
it after the wrapper exits on a warning.

--- a/scripts/gcc-wrapper.py
+++ b/scripts/gcc-wrapper.py
@@ -1,4 +1,4 @@
-#! /usr/bin/env python2
+#! /usr/bin/env python3
